Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we have sex, or do you want to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Kristoffer's started school now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I took him there yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a strange feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I sat there with a lump in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking he'll soon slip away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And have I been enough for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I hope I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he's turned into a fine boy.
